517 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (          WorkforceIQ demonstrates a complete educational machine learning workflow, from exploratory analysis and preprocessing to classifier comparison, threshold selection and evaluation. The React interface and FastAPI backend connect model inference with workforce analytics. The reported automated tests, production build and live integration demonstrate prototype implementation. The project provides practical experience in data science, API design, testing and cloud deployment while recognizing the need for independent validation, fairness assessment and calibration before any real-world use.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
